?><!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Trust & Methodology | TechSelectAI</title><meta name="description" content="Learn how TechSelectAI evaluates software, separates evidence from opinion, handles sponsorships, and keeps commercial relationships separate from recommendation scoring."><link rel="canonical" href="https://techselectai.com/trust"><meta property="og:title" content="Trust & Methodology | TechSelectAI"><meta property="og:description" content="See how TechSelectAI scores software, verifies evidence, handles reviews and sponsorships, and protects recommendation independence."><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:url" content="https://techselectai.com/trust"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"AboutPage","name":"TechSelectAI Trust & Methodology","url":"https://techselectai.com/trust","description":"How TechSelectAI evaluates software and separates evidence, reviews, commercial relationships and sponsorship from recommendation scoring."}</script><style>body{font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;background:#f7f9fc;color:#172033}.wrap{max-width:980px;margin:38px auto 72px;padding:0 22px}.hero{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dfe7ee;border-radius:22px;padding:30px}.eyebrow{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#2b7a78}.hero h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.08;margin:10px 0 12px}.hero p{font-size:18px;color:#526273;line-height:1.65;max-width:780px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin-top:18px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:16px;padding:20px}.card h2{margin-top:0;font-size:22px}.card p,.card li{color:#526273;line-height:1.65}.weights{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;margin-top:12px}.weight{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;background:#f8fbfd;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px}.callout{margin-top:18px;padding:18px 20px;border-left:4px solid #2b7a78;background:#eef8f7;border-radius:10px}.links{margin-top:22px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.links a{color:#123b67;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}.fine{font-size:13px;color:#64748b}@media(max-width:700px){.hero h1{font-size:32px}.grid,.weights{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">Trust & Methodology</div><h1>How TechSelectAI makes software recommendations</h1><p>TechSelectAI combines structured buyer requirements, deterministic scoring, product evidence, verified user reviews and public review intelligence. The goal is to make technology decisions explainable—not mysterious.</p><div class="callout"><strong>Commercial relationships never determine TechSelectAI recommendation scores or rankings.</strong> Sponsored placements are clearly identified and kept separate from recommendation scoring.</div></section><div class="grid"><section class="card"><h2>Who operates TechSelectAI</h2><p>TechSelectAI is operated by Barmageyat. Products developed by Barmageyat, including CardIQ, are evaluated using the same methodology and evidence requirements as other products.</p><p>Ownership disclosure is kept separate from scoring so users can distinguish product fit from commercial context.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>How recommendations work</h2><p>The AI helps interpret business needs and map them into structured requirements. The final curated product fit score is calculated deterministically rather than assigned by the AI.</p><p>Fit score and evidence confidence remain separate so a product can have a strong apparent fit while still showing areas where evidence needs verification.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>Scoring methodology</h2><p>The approved methodology currently uses these dimensions:</p><div class="weights"><div class="weight"><span>Functional Fit</span><strong>35%</strong></div><div class="weight"><span>Must-Have Compliance</span><strong>20%</strong></div><div class="weight"><span>Integration Fit</span><strong>10%</strong></div><div class="weight"><span>Security & Compliance</span><strong>10%</strong></div><div class="weight"><span>Deployment Fit</span><strong>10%</strong></div><div class="weight"><span>Commercial Fit</span><strong>7%</strong></div><div class="weight"><span>Regional Fit</span><strong>5%</strong></div><div class="weight"><span>Implementation Fit</span><strong>3%</strong></div></div><p class="fine">If an optional dimension was not evaluated, it is excluded and the remaining evaluated dimensions are re-normalized. Missing information is not silently treated as a perfect score.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>Evidence standards</h2><p>Capability support is tracked with explicit states such as supported, plan-dependent, partially supported, add-on, third-party integration, unknown/not yet verified, and not supported.</p><p><strong>Unknown does not mean unsupported.</strong> It means TechSelectAI does not currently have enough evidence to make a stronger claim.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>Verified Reviews</h2><p>TechSelectAI Verified Reviews are a separate user-experience signal. Approved reviews can contribute to a first-party review score, but they do not replace evidence-based product fit.</p><p>Reviewer verification, moderation and reward handling are designed separately from review sentiment so rewards are never dependent on giving a positive rating.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>Public Review Intelligence</h2><p>Public Review Intelligence is another separate signal derived only from sources whose access and reuse basis permits analysis. It is not a copy of third-party review-platform scores.</p><p>Fit Score, Evidence Confidence, Verified Review Score and Public Review Intelligence are intentionally kept distinct.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>Sponsorship & CardIQ</h2><p>TechSelectAI may show clearly labeled sponsored placements, including contextual CardIQ promotions when relevant to a buyer's needs.</p><p>Sponsored messages are displayed outside the recommendation ranking and do not modify product scores, ordering or evidence status.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>Privacy principles</h2><p>TechSelectAI is designed to let users receive useful recommendations before creating an account. Saved consultations and account features are optional after value is delivered.</p><p>Analytics should collect the minimum information needed to improve the product and understand buyer intent without exposing private consultation text unnecessarily.</p></section></div><div class="links"><a href="/">Start a consultation</a><a href="/software">Explore software</a><a href="/llms.txt">AI discovery guide</a></div></main></body></html>